[{"client_msg_id":"b528fa7a-3938-46fb-81d6-c6a066b86360","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"Rust には詳しくないけど、どっかから build/release な workflow ファイル探して、移植してみようかな…","ts":"1631091261.366100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"otxu","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lp9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"397f443a-45a1-4f04-af33-09c3c17dace0","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"いやまあ、横道ですが","ts":"1631090477.365000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4s07R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f72919af-5bf5-41eb-b675-b88c47d6cf06","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"```  let g:lsp_settings['yaml-language-server'] = {\n    \\  'workspace_config': {\n    \\    'yaml': {\n    \\       'schemas': {\n    \\         '\u003chttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/compose-spec/compose-spec/master/schema/compose-spec.json\u003e' : 'docker-compose.y*ml',\n    \\       },\n    \\       'completion': v:true,\n    \\       'hover': v:true,\n    \\       'validate': v:true,\n    \\     }\n    \\   }\n    \\ }```\nとか","ts":"1631090452.364600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PTka"}]},{"client_msg_id":"639bbc2d-89cd-4a43-a978-f3806a0cc1d2","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あと、yamlのサーバでもjson schemaいけますね","ts":"1631090413.364300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6rZPX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"61c39968-6b80-4571-8790-7b318cd589d4","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"taplo-lsp のバイナリあるといいですね。あれば vim-lsp-settings のローカルインストールにシュッと対応できる。バイナリリリース関連の話は止まっちゃってる感じ？がありそうですね(taplo-cli の話ですが、やるなら taplo-lsp とかも同じタイミングだろうと) \u003chttps://github.com/tamasfe/taplo/issues/90\u003e","ts":"1631090395.363700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0PL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0a15e4cb-37dd-4269-83a9-a4c106158ff2","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"最悪 schema  を vim-lsp-settings に置いてもらうといった方法もあるかもしれません。これは json の LS で使うschemas (schemasのschemas？)がこんなふうに置かれてます \u003chttps://github.com/mattn/vim-lsp-settings/tree/master/data\u003e","ts":"1631090252.362800","thread_ts":"1631088661.357800","subtype":"thread_broadcast","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ooge"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"6422dc6e-bbcc-4a19-a600-2ee3732f1532","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"補完は特定のファイル名以外は(自作しないと)ないのと、最初に一度設定ファイルのダウンロードみたいな独自コマンドを叩くなりしないと補完出してくれないかもしれないです","ts":"1631088661.357800","thread_ts":"1631088661.357800","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w4g"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"15baa498-050f-4981-8bda-617e83003b8a","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"duplicate key とかも警告してくれるな","ts":"1631089141.362600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k6Z9W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11fcc362-0377-48a3-bf94-14fa8090b8b1","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CQ57P4XU4/p1631081018351500\u003e\nこれ、Windows でも動きました","ts":"1631089061.362100","attachments":[{"fallback":"[September 7th, 2021 11:03 PM] yaegassy: vim-lsp (素の) の試した設定です。簡素。補完はこれだけでは Neovim built-in LSP 同様動きませんでした\n```augroup LspTaplo\n  au!\n  au User lsp_setup call lsp#register_server({\n      \\ 'name': 'taplo',\n      \\ 'cmd': {server_info-\u0026gt;['taplo-lsp', 'run']},\n      \\ 'allowlist': ['toml'],\n      \\ })\naugroup END```","id":1,"author_id":"U7TMPGWJ0","author_name":"yaegassy","author_subname":"yaegassy","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U7TMPGWJ0","author_icon":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a36a7ed02d64ce6f40a20ebfe0a9f59d.jpg?s=48\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0025-48.png","text":"vim-lsp (素の) の試した設定です。簡素。補完はこれだけでは Neovim built-in LSP 同様動きませんでした\n```augroup LspTaplo\n  au!\n  au User lsp_setup call lsp#register_server({\n      \\ 'name': 'taplo',\n      \\ 'cmd': {server_info-\u0026gt;['taplo-lsp', 'run']},\n      \\ 'allowlist': ['toml'],\n      \\ })\naugroup END```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #tech-lsp","ts":1631081018.351500,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CQ57P4XU4/p1631081018351500","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CQ57P4XU4/p1631081018351500"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"subara","count":2,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c6BSe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d8f4e2d2-c848-4cdf-b3d5-37addddd174e","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"vimlで上手く書けるか分からないんですが、ちょっとvim-lspの方で叩けるかやってみます","ts":"1631088803.361700","edited":{"user":"U01BY3SDBRS","ts":"1631088819.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qMB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d760406a-c0a5-4652-a74c-21f67575d38b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"でしょうかね","ts":"1631088730.359500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"naf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ee1cf4cd-00b3-4e39-9ab7-913c653fc05f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"(kkiやまさんが追加してくれたから)","ts":"1631088725.359100","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1631088752.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=FY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c56846b5-5113-4456-b05c-b808f8b42153","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"現状ならdeinのtomlがvimmerではアンパイっぽい","ts":"1631088712.358400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RYLH9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6422dc6e-bbcc-4a19-a600-2ee3732f1532","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"補完は特定のファイル名以外は(自作しないと)ないのと、最初に一度設定ファイルのダウンロードみたいな独自コマンドを叩くなりしないと補完出してくれないかもしれないです","ts":"1631088661.357800","thread_ts":"1631088661.357800","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w4g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3bec674-9499-4467-8cd2-dda5107cdd8a","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"とりあえず `taplo-lsp` は色々まだ何かありそうですね(本体側か、必須設定等あるのかなど)","ts":"1631081788.352700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wfrv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ddef79e4-840d-432b-ad83-b92422f4a5f8","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"coc.nvim の拡張をインストールしない LS の直接登録の設定です。\n```{\n  // ..snip\n  \"languageserver\": {\n    \"taplo-lsp\": {\n      \"command\": \"taplo-lsp\",\n      \"args\": [\"run\"],\n      \"filetypes\": [\"toml\"]\n    }\n  }\n  // ..snip\n}```","ts":"1631081709.352500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j7d="}]},{"type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"coc.nvim でも入力の度にエラーでますが 診断(diagnostics) は動きました。","ts":"1631081638.352100","files":[{"id":"F02DWHD4GSY","created":1631081634,"timestamp":1631081634,"name":"coc-nvim-taplo.png","title":"coc-nvim-taplo.png","mimetype":"image/png","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"png","pretty_type":"PNG","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":182963,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02DWHD4GSY/coc-nvim-taplo.png","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02DWHD4GSY/download/coc-nvim-taplo.png","original_h":898,"original_w":1108,"thumb_64":"https: