,"type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CLKR04BEF/p1610688371030800\u003e","ts":"1631079280.345400","attachments":[{"fallback":"[January 14th, 2021 9:26 PM] raa0121: java-language-server が2つある","id":1,"author_id":"U06ECBRTJ","author_name":"raa0121","author_subname":"raa0121","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U06ECBRTJ","author_icon":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/35b032d7b2d4182b0c2de1ef85ba91f2.jpg?s=48\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0012-48.png","text":"java-language-server が2つある","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #plugins","ts":1610688371.030800,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CLKR04BEF/p1610688371030800","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CLKR04BEF/p1610688371030800"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ay1bo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"02d7b5b7-eac5-4d07-b1e6-b78ca3a850c8","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"あ、それ私も前に見つけた気がします","ts":"1631079243.345200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hppd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1708eaaa-b499-4fbf-b3ca-6903fc8fa976","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"想定外～","ts":"1631079230.344900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/AF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57a29c21-ff39-4872-b5e9-7d83f1d88ab1","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"\u003c@U03C6TEAZ\u003e (cc \u003c@UAZ33BKV2\u003e)\nvim-lsp-settingsのREADMEのSupported Languagesに `Java | java-language-server` が2つあるんですけど、これは何が間違ってるんですかね?\n\n\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/vim-lsp-settings/blame/master/README.md#L116\u003e\n\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/vim-lsp-settings/blame/master/README.md#L123\u003e","ts":"1631079177.344700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HTgn+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9588c5c4-ea44-4854-8b75-8f3ab266c242","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"Windows でもビルドしてみるか","ts":"1631078958.344000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E8sXU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ed14ecb-82fc-4332-990e-293d86d6d57d","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"できました！\n```$ taplo-lsp --version\nTaplo LSP 0.2.5```","ts":"1631078869.343500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"68hm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b7cd0cb-bf6b-4668-9376-17459389859a","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"なんとなく勘で toolchain を `nightly` にしたらとりあえずビルドできそうな雰囲気あります(toolchainの切り替え方を忘れてしまっていてそれを調べるのに時間がかかりましたw)","ts":"1631078807.343300","edited":{"user":"U7TMPGWJ0","ts":"1631078881.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sJGM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"af58b46f-503d-44a6-b997-ea321555edf0","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"つ、つらい。。。","ts":"1631078696.342500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sZ/y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"161ac798-330e-49bf-b4f8-a21d6c2d024f","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"Rust 製でバイナリが提供されていないツールはビルドが長いので腰が重いな...って感じなのですが\n試してみようと cargo install はじめたら、5分後位に clap コンパイルできないって感じでビルドエラーになってしまった...","ts":"1631078306.342200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":2,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bmPM4"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U02DNLYVARG","text":"\u003c@U02DNLYVARG\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1631040698.339200","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null}]
